Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.12.61-rt81 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.12.61 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.12-rt
  Head SHA1: a08cc8f7785d94117847a28febe66490ec9f2bcb


Or to build 3.12.61-rt81 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.12.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.12.61.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.12/patch-3.12.61-rt81.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve
